anks for joining us on Special Report.\par \par \uc2 WILL CAIN, FOX NEWS HOST: I'm Will Cain in for Laura Ingraham and this is a special edition of THE INGRAHAM ANGLE from New York City tonight.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court announcing late tonight that they will hear Trump's appeal to the Colorado ruling that banned him from the state's primary ballot. Plus, how far will Special Counsel Jack Smith go in his investigation into \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , we have obtained shocking new video of what happened after he dispatched agents to the home of former Black Voices for Trump Director Harrison Floyd, his attorney is here exclusively. But first.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2  (D), PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: The talks about the blood of America is being poisoned, echoing the same exact language used in Nazi Germany. He proudly posts on social media, the words that best describe his 2024 campaign, quote, revenge, quote, power, and, quote, dictatorship. There's no confusion about who Trump is, what he intends to do.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CAIN: There it is. Mr. Unifier-in-Chief's official ramp up to comparing his predecessor to Hitler. In the very same speech, he pretended like he was the only guy around who could save America.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: Today, I make this sacred pledge to you, the defense, protection, and preservation of American democracy will remain as it has been, the central cause of my presidency.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CAIN: He wants you to think that the next 11 months are not about getting America back on track where she should be, where people aren't living paycheck-to-paycheck, where our borders aren't being overrun, where people aren't scared to walk down the street. No, he wants you to think it's all about what he calls democracy.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: Where the democracy is still America's sacred cause is the most urgent question of our time. That's what the 2024 election is all about.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CAIN: Is it? Because just after Biden stood there in front of multiple American flags, calling Trump the greatest threat to our democracy, we learned the \uc2 Supreme Court of the United States\uc2  is hearing a case about Democrats trying to take that very thing away, trying to take \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  off the ballot.\par \par \uc2 Joining us now is \uc2 Stephen Miller\uc2 , former Senior Advisor to President Trump and the Founder of America First Legal and Kurt Schlichter, retired \uc2 U.S. Army\uc2  Colonel and Senior Columnist at Townhall.com. Gentlemen, thanks for being with us tonight. Stephen --\par \par \uc2 STEPHEN MILLER\uc2 , FORMER SENIOR ADVISOR TO PRESIDENT TRUMP: Thank you.\par \par \uc2 CAIN: -- it's a pretty fearful message that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  angrily relayed to the American public about the threat represented by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . The threat to democracy will be -- will Americans in your estimation, be afraid they're about to lose their democracy?\par \par \uc2 MILLER: I think the clear purpose of Biden's message is two-fold. First, obviously, is to try to terrify suburban voters ahead of the elections. And that will be tremendously unsuccessful as we see in the polling. But the second and even more nefarious objective is trying to create the pretext, the predicate for a vast police and surveillance state. So, what you see is the enormous tools, the disposal, the Department of Justice, the enormous tools of the disposal of the \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2 , being arrayed for the purpose of trying to crush political dissent in America, censoring free speech, putting political dissidents in jail for outrageous sentences.\par \par \uc2 You see, for example, pro-life Americans being raided, being threatened with enormous jail time for non-violent activities, non-violent protests, while political allie