arlov,  Will Cain \par \uc2 8,445 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 December 2023\par \uc2 Fox News: The Five\par \uc2 FOXFIV\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2023 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2023 ASC Services II Media, LLC.  All materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the prior written permission of ASC Services II Media, LLC. You may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 NEIL CAVUTO, FOX NEWS CHANNEL ANCHOR: All right \uc2 Sean O'Brien\uc2 , the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2 ' general president here. And so again, maybe they do that, you know, talk or something at a diner, but it doesn't look very, very eminent right now. But you never know. You never know.\par \par \uc2 That will do it here. Another record on the Dow. We'll explore that tomorrow at 10:00 a.m. In the meantime, here's THE FIVE.\par \par \uc2 SHANNON BREAM, FOX NEWS CHANNEL ANCHOR: Hello, everyone, I'm Shannon Bream along with Kellyanne Conway, Jessica Tarlov, Will Cain, and Greg Gutfeld. It is 5:00 in New York City and this is THE FIVE.\par \par \uc2 California Governor \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  taking a swing at Republicans while discussing his state's problems. Right now, growing concerns that California is reverting back to its old ways after spending millions to clean up rampant homelessness and open-air drug markets for the APEC Summit. The Golden State Governor taking too liberal late-night T.V. and blaming the GOP for amplifying the quality-of-life issues.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 GOV. GAVIN NEWSOM (D-CA): They've been on a doom loop about San Francisco ever since \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2  became speaker. California has outperformed the American economy. It's the tentpole in American recovery.\par \par \uc2 And its values are stark. Contrast differences in daylight