up was hired for Jill Biden's bizarre White House Christmas video. The studio's website pushes every crazy leftist cause, you can imagine. From defund the police to getting rid of prisons and anti-racism activists.\par \par \uc2 You know, I really miss Melania Trump for lots of reasons in the White House but no more so than this week. The first year that we had Christmas there. She did the preview for the press. She invited kids from local schools.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Is that the little red trees?\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: Yes, it was very, very tastefully done. I can't believe you're going to defend any of this, but let's just talk about it in a second. I'll have the floor. Looks like I'll come to you.\par \par \uc2 And she -- even in 2020 during COVID, they had special events for the frontline workers, for the first responders. And to say nothing, Jessica, I guess, I go to you first of Thanksgiving 2019 Trump goes over to Afghanistan and serves a warm meal to the troops. Thanksgiving 2023, the same first lady who does this nonsense in the "people's house" goes with her husband to a $34 million spread in Nantucket, and doles out flew to the firehouse.\par \par \uc2 These people are out of touch. They're in our face. And I can't believe you're going to defend this. Did anybody do a \uc2 Google\uc2  search of who the dance troupe is here in New York City?\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: I don't know. I don't work for them. I did a \uc2 Google\uc2  search once I saw it was a topic. And we're going to talk about it yesterday. I don't think that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  going to Afghanistan and \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 's serving first responders here means that one is more --\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: In Nantucket.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Yes, it's a nice vacation spot where he goes annually with his entire family. Melania Trump also told \uc2 Stephanie Grisham\uc2 , one of her top aides I don't effing want to do this, but I have to, Stephanie.\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: It was a different Stephanie