ey obviously have.\par \par \uc2 So, this is all a P.R. war. But in addition to that it's a real war and Biden better get in there and start fighting it.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: What do you think of the president today?\par \par \uc2 PIERS MORGAN, FOX NEWS CHANNEL HOST: When he doesn't instill a lot of confidence, let's just put it politely. I completely concur with you, the commander-in-chief of the United States in situations like this, when a bunch of Americans, by the way, were also killed on October the 7th, they've already been actually killed in a proxy week by Iran. And Iran funding \uc2 Hamas\uc2 , it was clearly a massive operation. They put on lots of reports coming out now, but lots of training of \uc2 Hamas\uc2  terrorists by Iran, potentially in Iran as well.\par \par \uc2 So, Iran has already killed American civilians on October the 7th. And you look at \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , and you look at somebody and you think, is this a guy that's actually going to go through on what he's saying? If you're Iran, if you're Putin, if you're any of these adversaries right now, I think ever since he did that ridiculous overnight pull out in Afghanistan, he lost all authority with these adversaries. And I think they all fancy their chances that he will not carry through on his word. And I think that's a dangerous moment for America, a dangerous moment for Israel, and a dangerous moment for the world.\par \par \uc2 So, it's not good to see \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  exude that complete lack of confidence, or belief that you think he's going to carry out what he says he's going to carry out, because so far he hasn't.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: The \uc2 IDF\uc2  is itching to go in. And they can't like this delay at all.\par \par \uc2 DANA PERINO, FOX NEWS CHANNEL HOST: It was interesting, because let me point out, I'll start with Kirby. Kirby said yesterday that a ceasefire would only help \uc2 Hamas\uc2 , OK? But then, how is that not the same thing as a humanitarian pause as Pelosi