etwork, for Suzanne Scott our CEO for allowing me to have this platform to tell the story because it's incredibly important.\par \par \uc2 This is an American city, this should not be happening in any American city. They call this Chi-Raq for a reason. And it's unfortunate that this is where we are.\par \par \uc2 I'm going to use my voice every chance I've got. Again, it's my mission in life to change the trajectory here in the city of Chicago, Sean.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Let me tell you something. You're making a difference. In the end, I predict your advocacy, your outspoken voice will save lives. I pray to God I'm right.\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: We'll see that. We'll see that.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Gianno, great to see you, my friend.\par \par \uc2 CALDWELL: Thank you, Sean.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Many prayers for you and your family.\par \par \uc2 All right. That's all the time we have left this evening.\par \par \uc2 Quick programming note and that is tomorrow, after the second Republican presidential debate, we will be live from the post-debate spin room in California. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\uc2 , Nikki Haley, Tim Scott, \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 , and yeah, even \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  all that are joining us on the set.\par \par \uc2 All right. But that's all the time we have tonight. Please set your DVR so you never ever ever miss an episode of "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, let not your heart be troubled. Greg Gutfeld is standing by to put a smile on your face. Have a great night.\par \par \uc2 Document SHAN000020230927ej9q00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Biden Speaks At White House Event On Gun Safety; New Jersey Senator Menendez, Wife Indicted On Bribery Charges; Former GOP Texas Representative Reacts To Latest Border Surge; Biden: Expanding Legal Pathways For Entry; CBP Sources: FY2023 Sets Record For Encounters; Border Patrol Union: 100K Released In Last Three Weeks; \uc2 UAW\uc2  Expands Strike At \