logy.\par \par \uc2 I saw a woman coming into work today. She took off her mask and lit a cigarette. I'm just happy my marathon training can resume tomorrow because we got a big race coming up.\par \par \uc2 I also want to note something to all of you climate crazies. New England's dark day. It occurred in 1780, this was when the entire area of New England went pitch black around noon, people were lighting candles. It was because of forest fires in Canada.\par \par \uc2 We did not have the internal combustion engine in 1780. So, this stuff just happens. Fires in the forest are actually less prevalent.\par \par \uc2 Is this the apocalypse? Are we looking for the signs? We had a UFO situation the other day. I don't know, we had an eclipse. Remember, Trump was looking up there with the stupid goggles. I found a frog in my pool. That we had a pandemic.\par \par \uc2 GREG GUTFELD, FOX NEWS CHANNEL HOST: You have a pool?\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: There are a lot of suspicious things here. How about the witches in Canada that were feasting on the deer flesh under the moonlight?\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Which ones?\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: You didn't see "JESSE WATTERS PRIMETIME" last night?\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: No, I didn't. OK, I'm going to go to you, Greg.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: He really wants that 8:00 p.m. slot.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Yes, started in Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: All right. All right, Greg. You know, can -- doesn't matter what the question is.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: The WNBA -- the WNBA which plays indoors suspended their games. You know why? There's a good reason, they were worried about the health of their fan.\par \par \uc2 So, already, the media is blaming climate change. ABC is connecting it to climate change. USA Today asked if the fires were actually caused by climate change.\par \par \uc2 And Harold, you're right, your intuition is that it's manmade. 90 percent of all wildfires are started by humans. Fires left unattended, burning of debris, discarded 