ncredible surprise. Instead of \uc2 Tupperware\uc2  or crock pot, in the Van Cleve's kitchen cabinet, you'll find a slide to the basement. The Van Cleves have three daughters who had the idea for the slides installation, which was expensive. It's $10,000. But the family has said the slide is much more fun -- it's much more about fun than convenience, although it certainly can account for both.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: It's cool.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Did you say Van Cleve?\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: You wish.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: It's the top video on the day we (INAUDIBLE)\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: By the way, do you know -- do you know who has one of those on their desks? \uc2 Larry Kudlow\uc2  . \uc2 Larry Kudlow\uc2  has to go straight to the cafeteria.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: He does not.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: No.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: He does --\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: She said he does not.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: I've seen them.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Yes, it's amazing. I can't believe your doubting me.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: I am doubting.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: All right, "SPECIAL REPORT" is up next. Hey, Gillian.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2023 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2023 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document FOXFIV0020230324ej3n00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Laura's 2024 Advice For Top GOP Candidates; Biden Officials Sat By As The U.S. Economy Burned To The Ground; Laura's Unsolicited Campaign Advice To Team Trump; DEI Has Taken Over The DOD; Manhattan District Attorney May Indict Former President Trump In Connection To Hush Money Payments To